nt|^z@3^b@2^^|lb|*CLead for South by clicking that card on the right.^^H7^3SJ97HQJ874D76CK63|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In a suit contract, if I choose to lead a heart, the @HQ is the correct lead. But in NT, if you lead the Queen that promises QJ10 or QJ9 (e.g. a 3-card sequence or broken sequence). Therefore, a low heart lead is best. True, on this hand a spade lead works best, but there is no way for me to know that.|
