sk|s|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now double dummy, a spade shift is best. I also know that East will be taking 4 diamonds, at least 3 clubs, and at least 2 hearts for 9 tricks. So our only hope is if partner has AKxx in spades and we can take five tricks before. Therefore, I will lead a small spade.|
PG| ***** 8 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I am not sure I would actually work that out at the table but I do believe it is possible to do so.|
