UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|That is the danger of playing in a 7-card fit. You sometimes "lose control" of the hand, meaning you run out of trump before the opponents do. On this hand, 3@C is probably a slightly better contract despite being one level higher.|
PG| ***** 38 ***** |


