UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A trump lead was correct. I am not sure the best way to play the hand, but North's line definitely worked out okay. Once there is a spade lead you can count 3 spades, 2 clubs, and 2 hearts. You can try for a diamond ruff as the 8th trick, or for 3-3 spades, or for an extra club trick. All happen to work here.
|
PG| ***** 59 ***** |


