mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P|mb|2H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I think 2@H is North's best bid. In theory, using Bergen evaluation, North can count 9 HCP plus one for the 3 honor diamond suit theoretically giving North a 3-card limit raise. But the 4-3-3-3 distribution hand is a downgrade, so I think 2@H is just right.|
PG| ***** 61 ***** |


mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|MB|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Let me use |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenhandevaluation,Bergen Hand Evaluation^*N|CP||FP||at| to see what I should bid. I have 16 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=bergenstartingpoints,Bergen Starting Points^*N|CP||FP||at|--14 HCP, 1 length point, and 1 quality suit point for 3 honors in hearts.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow a link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
PG| ***** 62 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Then I can add only 2 points for two side 4-card suit and only 2 points for void (instead of 4) for 20 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=declarerpoints,Bergen Declarer Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. That is enough to bid 4@H.|

n#|9|at|^^^fIf you do follow the link you can return  HERE  by clicking the  |fp|1|n#|3|at|@L|fp||n^|3|at|   icon button, top left.|
