UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So despite the fact that North had a max 2@H bid, 4@H was not a good contract because of the bad fit. It was lucky we were down only 1. That happens sometimes particularly when one person has a void and the other person has honors in that suit.|
PG| ***** 80 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|As to the best opening lead. It is a pure guess. Generally speaking it is a bad idea to lead a singleton trump. So I wouldn't lead that. Leading away from a KJ can often give away a trick although not always. I probably lead a spade as that is less likely to give away a trick. But as I said there is no clear correct lead in this board.|
PG| ***** 81 ***** |


