mb|2H|mb|D|mb|R|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has no clearcut action. Redouble is not bad, although I happen to play that as a convention where it shows a doubleton honor in hearts. But if you don't play that, here redouble is good idea. It probably shows some strength and lack of 3 hearts.|
