mb|3H|mb|P|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I like North pass best, as the @DQJ are dubious and we have only 8 hearts fit. In general, you stretch to bid game with a 9-card fit, and are conservative with an 8 card fit.|
